            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="connect-step-number">2</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Launch T3 Code.</h3>
              <p>One command starts the local server and opens the web app.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="connect-step-number">3</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Pair any screen.</h3>
              <p>
